                <mxCell id="web" value="&lt;b&gt;web&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;[Container: FastAPI / uvicorn — Fly process]&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;REST /api (runs, briefs, tasks, actions, artifacts, orders, cost, export) · SSE stream · Stripe webhook receiver · checkout redirect · serves the console bundle&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1168BD;strokeColor=#0B4884;fontColor=#ffffff;verticalAlign=top;arcSize=6;spacing=6;" parent="1" vertex="1">
